sequenceDiagram
  actor Teacher as 教师
  participant System as OnlineJudgeForSE 系统边界
  Teacher->>System: OP-GR-01 保存成绩项与计算规则
  Note over Teacher,System: LAB/HWK 来源编号须为正整数<br/>OTHER_COURSE_ITEM 来源编号可为空
  alt 字段与规则合法
    System-->>Teacher: 返回已保存成绩项
  else 字段/规则/权限非法
    System-->>Teacher: 返回受控错误且不修改既有规则
  end
  opt 教师单独校验当前规则
    Teacher->>System: POST /courses/{courseId}/grade-rules/validate
    System-->>Teacher: 返回 valid、totalIncludedWeight 和 errors
  end
